{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/41221-recruitment-mage-the-awakening-after-the-2003-hoax","id":41221,"title":"[Recruitment] [Mage the Awakening] After the 2003 Hoax","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-02T11:52:55-08:00","id":41221,"title":"[Recruitment] [Mage the Awakening] After the 2003 Hoax","content":"Given the chance to run a game on here, I think it would neat to play a Mage Game starts in the spring of 2003 in Paris, Texas. I see the game starting by many mages from all over the place coming to Paris, Texas because they believed that there was a Bound there about to awaken and create havoc. This turned out to be a complete hoax, and the real game begins from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 01-02-2014, 04:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T14:19:14-08:00","id":41318,"title":"","content":"I might be interested, so long as we don't use the Revised metaplot. I only have access to 2e Rules and have little interest in Revised.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T14:27:16-08:00","id":41322,"title":"","content":"What's a Bound?","signature":